(cb3) IN[On the cross hid](d') cru(f)ce(h') la(h)té(hi)bat(h.) (,) so[the Deity only](g')la(f) Dé(e')i(d)tas,(d.) (;)
At[but here humanity hides simultaneously](d') hic(f) la(h')tet(h) si(hi)mul(h.) (,) et(g') hu(f)má(e')ni(d)tas :(d.) (:)
Am(h)bo[both nevertheless believing and](h) ta(ij)men(k) cre(kj)dens(h.) (,) at(i')que(h) cón[confessing](g')fi(f)tens,(e.) (;)
Pe[I ask what the repenting thief has asked](f')to(h) quod(g') pe(f)tí(e[ll:1]d)vit(e.) (,) la(f')tro(d) paé(e')ni(d)tens.(d.) (::) 
4. Pla[ ~ ~ wounds, like Thomas,](d')gas,(f) sic(h')ut(h) Tho(hi)mas,(h.) (,) non[I do not look at](g') in(f)tú(e')e(d)or :(d.) (;)
De[God nevertheless](d')um(f) ta(h')men(h) me[my](hi)um(h.) (,) te[I confess thee](g') con(f)fí(e')te(d)or :(d.) (:)
Fac[make me in thee always more to believe](h) me(h) ti(ij)bi(k) sem(kj)per(h.) (,) ma(i')gis(h) cré(g')de(f)re,(e.) (;)
In[in thee to have hope](f') te(h) spem(g') ha(f)bé(e[ll:1]d)re,(e.) (,) te[thee to love](f') di(d)lí(e')ge(d)re.(d.) (::)

